VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'example, but what about body proportions, right? We care a lot about those. We want to make sure that that\'s accurate. And like I talked about in the influencer course, to do that, you\'re going to need a reference that provides that information to the model. Here, we'

[04:44] [scene:talk]
