[04:56] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'the course as well. And we\'re actually going to leave our prompt the same. For our prompt, we\'re going to make a couple basic adjustments here. We want to specify to focus specifically on the character and change the outfit. Reason being that if we don\'t, some of this'

[05:08] [scene:talk]
