AUDIO: 'data is going to bleed through. Here is kind of what I mean by that. So, we still get some of that pink dress, and then the wallpaper is ending up in the elevator. But we want to try and avoid this by specifying that in our prompt. At the end of the prompt, I\'m just going'

[05:20] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
