[05:33] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'good. And now what we can do is also start stacking some of our LoRAs. So, I have this Realistic Snapshot LoRA, also going to enable the Filter Bypass LoRA. You don\'t have to do that. Filter Bypass is specifically meant for kind of more'

[05:46] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'promiscuous content. We\'re not really doing that here, but I found that it does make a difference for the better usually. So, if we run this again, we\'re going to get a very similar result, but one that is slightly closer to the influencer style that we\'re looking for.'

